: <select name="MUSIC_SOURCE" size="1" id="tm-music-source">
  <?=mk_option($fx["MUSIC_SOURCE"] ?? "local", "local", "本地目录")?>
  <?=mk_option($fx["MUSIC_SOURCE"] ?? "local", "navidrome", "Navidrome")?>
  <?=mk_option($fx["MUSIC_SOURCE"] ?? "local", "fnos", "飞牛音乐(FnOS)")?>
  </select>

本地音乐目录:
: <span class="tm-path-field ucwc-path-field">
    <input type="text" class="tm-local-path ucwc-local-path ucwc-path-dir" id="tm-music-local-dir" name="MUSIC_LOCAL_DIR" maxlength="512" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($fx["MUSIC_LOCAL_DIR"] ?? "")?>" placeholder="点击浏览选择音乐目录（如 /mnt/user/Music）" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" data-pickfolders="true" data-pickcloseonfile="false" data-pickroot="<?= htmlspecialchars($ucwc_pickroot) ?>" data-picktop="<?= htmlspecialchars($ucwc_pickroot) ?>" data-pickmatch=".*">
    <button type="button" class="tm-path-browse ucwc-path-browse" title="浏览目录" aria-label="浏览目录"><i class="fa fa-folder-open-o" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
  </span>

Navidrome 地址:
: <input type="url" id="tm-navidrome-url" name="MUSIC_NAVIDROME_URL" maxlength="512" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($fx["MUSIC_NAVIDROME_URL"] ?? "http://127.0.0.1:4533")?>" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:4533" autocomplete="url" spellcheck="false">

Navidrome 用户:
: <input type="text" id="tm-navidrome-user" name="MUSIC_NAVIDROME_USER" maxlength="128" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($fx["MUSIC_NAVIDROME_USER"] ?? "")?>" placeholder="Navidrome 用户名" autocomplete="username" spellcheck="false">

Navidrome 密码:
: <input type="password" id="tm-navidrome-password" name="MUSIC_NAVIDROME_PASSWORD" maxlength="256" value="" placeholder="<?=is_file($navidrome_secret_path) && filesize($navidrome_secret_path) > 0 ? "已安全保存；留空保持不变" : "输入 Navidrome 密码"?>" autocomplete="new-password">

Navidrome 连接:
: <span class="tm-inline-actions">
    <button type="button" id="tm-btn-test-navidrome" class="tm-pill-btn" title="直接使用当前填写内容测试，不必先应用">测试连接</button>
    <span id="tm-navidrome-status" class="tm-muted"><?=is_file($navidrome_secret_path) && filesize($navidrome_secret_path) > 0 ? "密码已保存" : "尚未保存密码"?></span>
      </div>
